---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="About" description="About Mika Flowers and this blog.">
  <section>
    <h2>About</h2>
    <p>
      I'm Mika. I like Linux, desktop software, pixel art, music, writing, and
      figuring out how things work by building them.
    </p>
    <p>
      Most of what I write here comes from active projects: bugs I had to trace,
      design choices that surprised me, and systems I understand better after
      wrestling with them for a while.
    </p>
    <p>
      The goal is not to pretend I know everything. It's to leave a useful trail
      of what I tried, what broke, what worked, and what I learned next.
    </p>
    <p><a href="https://github.com/miflow13">github.com/miflow13</a></p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
